WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.430
- [Narrator] Meet David Aguilar.

00:00:20.944 --> 00:00:21.860
- [Narrator] When David was born,

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.110
his right arm hadn't fully developed.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.410
- [Narrator] And while some would see this

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:40.010
as a disadvantage, David
is just a regular kid.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.170
He likes EDM.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:43.500
He goes by the name, Hand Solo.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.610
Get it?

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.220
He has an embarrassing dad.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:48.440
He goes to school.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.950
And, he can open doors with his Lego arm.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.480
So cool.

00:00:56.628 --> 00:00:58.820
Growing up, he was obsessed with Lego.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:02.520
So much so, he wanted to make
it a part of him, literally.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:11.470
- [Narrator] Unfortunately,
the Lego bricks

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:14.500
weren't strong enough and it
wasn't for another nine years

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.700
'til he would try again.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:36.230
- [Narrator] That model,
the MK1, only took five days

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:39.260
to build, of course,
like any good inventor,

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:41.340
he got straight to work on an upgrade.

